id: pm-rl-corpusnofollow
title: Evaluate descriptor-relative corpus publication under concurrent parent replacement
description: "PR #94 canonicalizes corpus output and rechecks alias and canonical parents immediately before exclusive creation. As identified in review thread PRRT_kwDOTqJmqs6u58zn, path checks still leave a small window against a hostile concurrent filesystem writer. Evaluate descriptor-relative no-follow creation with an explicit cross-platform support contract; retain exclusive creation, stable refusals, Git-independent real tracker tests and unchanged source bytes. The review-round fix narrows the window and makes no atomic containment claim."
